`MeasureTheory.lintegral_ofReal_dist_sq_le_of_isApproximatingPair_of_integrable_mul` up to
`MeasureTheory.mul_measure_setOf_lt_modulusBased_le_of_isApproximatingPair_of_integrable_mul` --
